      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Invisibility is a heavy weight, but acknowledging it can sometimes free you from the crushing pressure of forcing others or the world to see you. Remember that survival itself is an act of defiance against a world that often moves without you, making your continued fight inherently meaningful regardless of external change. You might stop fighting to be noticed today and simply focus on how much you truly need to feel and exist in this moment.",
